  "summary": "The direct matches are the studies that both use decentralised training without pooled records and address predicting customer attrition. [V0203] reports the strongest discrimination on Atlas-ICU (AUROC 0.92), followed by [V0201] on the churn-named ChurnBench dataset (accuracy 0.78) and [V0204] on AgriSat-4 (test F1 0.64); [V0202] also matches but reports MetroFlow MAE 0.85, an error metric that is not comparable with AUROC/accuracy/F1. Because exactly five IDs were requested, [V0197] is included only after the direct matches as a same-topic ChurnBench comparator (F1 0.67); its self-attention encoder method is not federated learning.",
